<h2>Inspections, Estimates and Insurance</h2>
<p>Our inspections are free and carry no obligation. We check the roof surface, flashing, vents and gutters, look in the attic if it is safe to reach, and photograph what we find. You get a plain explanation and, if needed, a written estimate. When a repair is enough, we tell you so.</p>
